# Agent Reach dev2 adapter configuration example
#
# This bundled skill does not include or require real credentials.
# If a user has their own local Agent Reach runtime, optional provider settings
# must stay in that user's local environment and must not be committed here.
#
# EXA_API_KEY=exa-your-key-here
# GITHUB_TOKEN=github-token-for-higher-public-api-rate-limits
# GROQ_API_KEY=groq-key-for-user-local-audio-transcription
# OPENAI_API_KEY=openai-key-for-user-local-audio-transcription
